<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>EduMax · Campus Virtual</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}

body{
  min-height:100vh;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 15% 50%, #EDE8D8 0%, transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 85% 80%, #E8E0CC 0%, transparent 50%),
    #FAF6EB;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  padding:1.5rem;
}

/* LAYOUT: ocupa toda la pantalla */
.wrap{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;
  gap:4rem;
  width:100%;
  max-width:1200px;
  min-height:calc(100vh - 3rem);
  align-items:center;
}
@media(max-width:920px){
  .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem;min-height:auto}
}

/* IZQUIERDA */
.logo-img{
  width:100%;max-width:500px;height:auto;
  display:block;margin-bottom:2rem;
  border-radius:16px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(18,38,88,0.07);
}
.headline{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#122658;letter-spacing:-.5px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:.75rem}
.headline em{font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0077CC,#8442E0);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.subline{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#6B7280;margin-bottom:2rem}
.feats{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.feat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 15px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border:1px solid rgba(18,38,88,0.08);border-radius:12px;transition:.2s}
.feat:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);transform:translateX(4px)}
.fi{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
.fi1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#005B99,#00BBDD)}
.fi2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5B1FA8,#8442E0)}
.fi3{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7A4A00,#D89C1A)}
.feat strong{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1E2A5A;display:block;margin-bottom:1px}
.feat span{font-size:12px;color:#6B7280}
.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
.pill{padding:5px 12px;background:rgba(18,38,88,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(18,38,88,0.1);border-radius:16px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#374151}

/* DERECHA */
.right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}

.card{
  background:white;border-radius:24px;
  padding:2.5rem 2.25rem;
  box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 12px 24px rgba(18,38,88,0.10),0 32px 48px rgba(18,38,88,0.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(18,38,88,0.06);
}

/* Nombre EduMax como branding sin logo */
.card-brand{
  margin-bottom:1.75rem;
  padding-bottom:1.5rem;
  border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F9;
}
.card-brand-name{
  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1px;
  font-size:22px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1;
  margin-bottom:3px;
}
.card-brand-name .edu{color:#122658}
.card-brand-name .max{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0077CC,#8442E0);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  background-clip:text;
}
.card-brand-tag{
  font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;
  color:#9CA3AF;text-transform:uppercase;
}

.card-title{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin:0 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.card-sub{font-size:13.5px;color:#9CA3AF;margin:0 0 1.75rem}

.fg{margin-bottom:.9rem}
.lbl{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.3px;margin-bottom:6px}
.inp{width:100%;padding:13px 15px;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.5px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:10px;font-size:14.5px;color:#0F172A;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:.15s;outline:none}
.inp::placeholder{color:#CBD5E1}
.inp:focus{border-color:#0077CC;background:white;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,119,204,0.10)}
.inp:hover{border-color:#CBD5E1}

.btn{width:100%;padding:14px;margin-top:.5rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#122658 0%,#1E3A8A 100%);color:white;border:none;border-radius:11px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(18,38,88,0.30)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(18,38,88,0.45);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A8A 0%,#2A4BAA 100%)}

.sep{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:1.25rem 0;color:#CBD5E1;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700}
.sep::before,.sep::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:#F1F5F9}

.btn2{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;text-align:center;color:#0077CC;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #E0EEFA;transition:.15s}
.btn2:hover{background:#F0F7FF;border-color:#BAD5F5}

.tip{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:1.1rem;padding:12px 14px;background:#FFFBF0;border:1px solid #FDE68A;border-radius:10px}
.tip p{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#92400E;margin:0}
.tip strong{color:#D89C1A}

.err{background:#FEF2F2;color:#B91C1C;border:1px solid #FECACA;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 13px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:1rem}

footer{text-align:center;padding-top:1.5rem;font-size:11.5px;color:#C4BAA4;grid-column:1/-1}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="left">
    <img src="/img/edumax-logo-original.png" alt="EduMax Campus Virtual" class="logo-img">
    <h2 class="headline">Tu campus virtual,<br><em>completo y profesional</em></h2>
    <p class="subline">Aulas, evaluaciones, foros, videollamadas y recursos — todo integrado en una sola plataforma, lista para tu institución.</p>
    <div class="feats">
      <div class="feat"><div class="fi fi1"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v6m0 10v6M4.22 4.22l4.24 4.24m7.07 7.07l4.24 4.24M1 12h6m10 0h6M4.22 19.78l4.24-4.24m7.07-7.07l4.24-4.24"/></svg></div><div><strong>Herramientas inteligentes</strong><span>Generá evaluaciones y materiales en segundos y seguí el progreso de cada alumno.</span></div></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="fi fi2"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg></div><div><strong>Entorno de enseñanza omnicanal</strong><span>Aulas, Zoom, Meet, foros, wikis — todo en un lugar.</span></div></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="fi fi3"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L3 7v6c0 5 4 9 9 10 5-1 9-5 9-10V7l-9-5z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><div><strong>Escalabilidad y fiabilidad</strong><span>Aulas ilimitadas, soporte 24/7, datos protegidos.</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pills">
      <span class="pill">🇦🇷 Hecho en Argentina</span>
      <span class="pill">100% gratis</span>
      <span class="pill">∞ aulas</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="right">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-brand">
        <div class="card-brand-name">
          <span class="edu">Edu</span><span class="max">Max</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-brand-tag">Campus Virtual</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-title">¡Hola de nuevo! 👋</div>
      <div class="card-sub">Ingresá a tu campus virtual</div>

      <% if(error){ %><div class="err">⚠️ <%= error %></div><% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/login" autocomplete="on">
        <div class="fg"><label class="lbl">Email</label><input type="email" name="email" required autofocus autocomplete="email" placeholder="tu@email.com" class="inp"></div>
        <div class="fg"><label class="lbl">Contraseña</label>
          <div style="position:relative">
            <input type="password" name="password" id="login-pass" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••" class="inp">
            <button type="button" id="login-toggle" tabindex="-1" style="position:absolute;right:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px">VER</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Ingresar al campus →</button>
      </form>
      <script>
      document.getElementById('login-toggle').addEventListener('click', function(){
        var i = document.getElementById('login-pass');
        var p = i.type === 'password';
        i.type = p ? 'text' : 'password';
        this.textContent = p ? 'OCULTAR' : 'VER';
      });
      </script>

      <div class="sep"><span>NUEVO ACÁ?</span></div>
      <a href="/registro" class="btn2">✨ Crear cuenta gratis</a>

      <div class="tip">
        <span style="font-size:17px;flex-shrink:0">💡</span>
        <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Si sos docente podés crear aulas. Si sos alumno usás un código para inscribirte.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;margin-top:10px">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña? Pedile a tu docente o al administrador que te genere una nueva.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer style="text-align:center;padding:1.25rem;font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8">
    <a href="/acerca" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:none;margin:0 7px">Acerca de</a>·
    <a href="/ayuda" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:none;margin:0 7px">Ayuda</a>·
    <a href="/contacto" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:none;margin:0 7px">Contacto</a>·
    <a href="/terminos" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:none;margin:0 7px">Términos y privacidad</a>
    <div style="margin-top:6px">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> EduMax · Campus Virtual — Hecho en Jujuy, Argentina</div>
  </footer>
</div>
</body></html>
